WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.420 --> 00:00:04.850
Lamp for admins. Part four: the dashboard and money.

2
00:00:05.210 --> 00:00:08.240
As an admin, Dashboard shows everyone's numbers.

3
00:00:08.830 --> 00:00:13.720
Merchants funded is the north star. Watch it against the same days last month.

4
00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:23.750
Reps puts every rep side by side: links sent, opened and signed, files, sent to funders, funded, commission, leads worked, and calls.

5
00:00:24.270 --> 00:00:28.480
Leads worked shows how many of their engine leads they've actually called.

6
00:00:28.910 --> 00:00:35.180
Funders shows each funder's files, offers, offer rate, time to offer, and average factor.

7
00:00:35.590 --> 00:00:42.760
Activity and health lists every time someone showed a Social Security number, or downloaded an application.

8
00:00:43.440 --> 00:00:48.270
Sign-ins shows who signed in, from where, and flags a new place or browser.

9
00:00:48.750 --> 00:00:52.400
Latest staff actions shows what each person opened and changed.

10
00:00:52.830 --> 00:00:56.500
Money is every deal Lamp has funded.

11
00:00:57.040 --> 00:01:01.730
Clawback watch lists deals inside their first thirty days, with the commission at stake.

12
00:01:02.110 --> 00:01:07.720
Renewal radar flags deals about forty percent paid. At half, it says Call now.

13
00:01:08.100 --> 00:01:16.710
Each deal shows what's owed and received. Change its status as it's paid off, renewed or defaulted, and record payments in its ledger.

14
00:01:17.210 --> 00:01:26.000
When a funder confirms the money went out, open the file, and record the funding with the commission points. The file moves to funded, and the merchant sees it.

15
00:01:26.300 --> 00:01:31.090
Feed the reps. Watch the board. Move files to funded.
